I. CORE AXIOM (FOUNDATIONAL TRUTH MODEL)
===============================================================================

The DVSM system is built on a single invariant axiom:

    Φ(L1) = Φ(L3) = Φ(L4) = Φ(L5) = ... = Φ(L∞)

Where:
- Φ = embedding function mapping system state into invariant space
- Equality = deterministic equivalence, not approximation

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
INTERPRETATION
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

A state is REAL iff:
- It is produced by deterministic execution (Ξ)
- It passes hash identity validation (S_ECHO)
- It converges across all system layers (L1–L∞)

